@SanderMertens 
I'm aware. I should have been a bit more clear but I deviated away from that design. I decoupled table sorting from querying because I had other use cases in mind where you want multiple sorts like 2d scroll areas. The editor in my game does exactly this. Hence the stable sort point.

Edit: In hind sight it might be better to make the default behavior for queries to also sort tables and have a `.sort_tables(false)` on the builder API to opt out of this.
